	abstract = {Statistical mechanics (SM) is the study of the connection between micro-physics
and macro-physics.1 Thermodynamics (TD) correctly describes a large class of
phenomena we observe in macroscopic systems. The aim of statistical mechanics
is to account for this behaviour in terms of the dynamical laws governing the
microscopic constituents of macroscopic systems and probabilistic assumptions.2},
